  m_Name: Srug
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Rarety: 2
  m_Description: When a soul's final cry is swallowed by the void, unheard by gods,
    men, or beasts, from the nothingness, it stirs.\nDrawn to the embers of forgotten
    sorrow, it rises. In the hollow silence where justice dies and hope withers,
    it feasts upon the soul's torment. \n\nBorn of grievance, it carries the fury
    of the forsaken, unleashing their vengeance upon a world blind to their pain.
    And when the storm of wrath is spent, comes the shadow again, fading into the
    nothingness... until cries another soul.
